      "enrich_attempted_at": "2026-04-27T04:08:03.251Z",
      "last_seen_at": "2026-04-27T04:08:03.251Z",
      "notice_content": "<p><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">各位同学：</span></p><p style=\"margin: 5px 0px 8px; white-space: normal; text-indent: 43px; line-height: 37px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">静园10号楼负一层女浴室目前已建成（<strong>见图1</strong>），将于本周四（4月16日）试运行。该浴室</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">共有两个区域（</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">见图</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">2</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">），开放时间如下：</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-indent: 43px; line-height: 37px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">（一）电热水器浴室区：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">位于静园</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">10</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">号楼负一层西侧，共</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">28</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">个淋浴位。开放时间：早</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">7:00-</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">晚</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">22:30</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 8px 0px 5px; white-space: normal; text-indent: 43px; line-height: 37px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">（二）直供水浴室区：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">位于静园</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">10</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">号楼负一层东侧，共</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">90</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">个淋浴位。开放时间：中午</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">12:00-</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">晚</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">22:30</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 8px 0px 5px; white-space: normal; text-indent: 43px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">温馨提示：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">．</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">电热水器浴室区非直供热水，热水量有限，请合理安排洗浴时间，建议尽量选择</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">12:00</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">后洗浴；</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-indent: 149px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">2</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">．电热水器水温较高，请自行调至合适水温后再行洗浴；</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">．试运行期间浴室使用安排如有调整，以浴室值班员现场引导为准。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://my.muc.edu.cn/comsys-portal-notice-web/upload/ueditor/2026415/9832bb79-36ff-4110-b0ab-05736909ed43.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 5px 0px 10px; white-space: normal; text-indent: 43px; line-height: 37px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">特此通知。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 5px 0px 10px; white-space: normal; text-indent: 43px; line-height: 37px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px; text-align: right;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin: 5px 0px 10px; white-space: normal; text-indent: 43px; line-height: 37px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px; text-align: right;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;丰台校区管委会办公室</span></p><p style=\"margin: 5px 0px 10px; white-space: normal; text-indent: 43px; line-height: 37px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2026</span><span style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋;\">年4月15日</span></p><p><br/></p>",
